{"id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-complete-representability.md","title":"Numeralwise Definition and Complete Representability","display":"df-complete-representability — Numeralwise Definition and Complete Representability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-complete-representability","aliases":["92-df-complete-representability"],"display":"df-complete-representability — Numeralwise Definition and Complete Representability","source":"第 VIII 章 p. 97，定义与 Proposition 1（PDF 114，已核对图像）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-complete-representability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-complete-representability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-representability — Numeralwise Definition and Complete Representability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 p. 97，定义与 Proposition 1（PDF 114，已核对图像）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\">\\(\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\">\\(\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k\\)</span> 为下文定义的公式与关系之间的二元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\vec n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\land(\\vec n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(\\neg F,\\mathbb N^k\\setminus A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\vec n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{32mm}\\land(\\vec n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(\\neg F,\\mathbb N^k\\setminus A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 define 与 completely represent 在不一致系统中不同：后者的两个双条件排除了错误正实例和错误负实例；前者只有两个单向条件，不一致系统会对任意集合满足它。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumDef}\">\\(\\mathrm{NumDef}\\)</span> 才保证同一公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 完全表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，不能不带一致性直接交换术语。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 p. 97，定义与 Proposition 1（PDF 114，已核对图像）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}representability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\Bigl[\n(\\vec n\\in A\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\\\\n&\\hspace{32mm}\\land(\\vec n\\notin A\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n}))\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(\\neg F,\\mathbb N^k\\setminus A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NumDef}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2052,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 representable in $S$ 指成员关系恰好对应正实例可证；本库旧 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 指正负数码实例可证，即 proof-theoretic definability。参见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-df-representable]]。Normal/Stable 是元语言的可证性封闭性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]；序数正规函数另属扩展材料。"},{"id":"b12fbadd1e3ae795","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里 $\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathfrak M}$ 是模型中的无参数语义可定义性。原书第 VIII 章 define a relation in S 则是正负标准数码实例分别可证的证明论性质，详见[[92-df-complete-representability]]。因此“定义是语义概念”只适用于本文件模型意义，不能拿来解释原书该章的 define。"},{"id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"沿用 $\\mathrm{Rep}_G$ 标签与符号，实际语义是原书第 VIII 章的 numeralwise definition：正确正实例与正确负实例分别可证。它不是原书第 V 章 representable 的“成员当且仅当正实例可证”。普通表示见[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；完全表示的双条件见[[92-df-complete-representability]]；一致性把本定义的同一见证提升为完全表示，见[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]。"},{"id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。"},{"id":"719f56999c0853ae","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{CRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，分别是数码定义与完全表示关系。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]与[[92-lem-definition-complete-representation]]区分双侧定义和完全表示。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-representability]]"}],"outgoing":["9758d74f9a5e939a","8bd18c4d476f594a"]}